<script setup lang="ts">import type{PostMedia}from"~/composables/usePostDetail";const props=defineProps<{media:PostMedia[];title:string}>();const active=ref(0),open=ref(false);const current=computed(()=>props.media[active.value]);function select(index:number){active.value=index}function next(){active.value=(active.value+1)%props.media.length}function previous(){active.value=(active.value-1+props.media.length)%props.media.length}function key(event:KeyboardEvent){if(!open.value)return;if(event.key==="Escape")open.value=false;if(event.key==="ArrowLeft")next();if(event.key==="ArrowRight")previous()}onMounted(()=>window.addEventListener("keydown",key));onBeforeUnmount(()=>window.removeEventListener("keydown",key));</script>
<template><section class="post-gallery" aria-label="رسانه‌های آگهی"><button class="post-gallery__main" type="button" @click="open=true"><img v-if="current" :src="current.url" width="1280" height="900" :alt="`${title}، تصویر ${active+1}`"><span v-else>بدون تصویر</span><b v-if="media.length">{{ (active+1).toLocaleString('fa-IR') }} از {{ media.length.toLocaleString('fa-IR') }}</b></button><div v-if="media.length>1" class="post-gallery__thumbs"><button v-for="(item,index) in media" :key="item.id" type="button" :class="{active:index===active}" @click="select(index)"><img :src="item.url" width="180" height="126" alt=""></button></div><Teleport to="body"><div v-if="open&&current" class="gallery-lightbox" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-label="نمایش تصاویر"><button class="gallery-close" type="button" aria-label="بستن" @click="open=false">×</button><button type="button" aria-label="تصویر قبلی" @click="previous">‹</button><img :src="current.url" :alt="title"><button type="button" aria-label="تصویر بعدی" @click="next">›</button></div></Teleport></section></template>
